**3** ={δέλτος}, **tablet**, {{LXX|LXX.Tob.7.14.}}
**II** **book**, {{Refs 5th c.BC+|5th c.BC: Eupolis Comicus 304, Theognetus Comicus 1.8, 5th-6th c.BC: Plato Philosophus “Apologia” 26d, etc.; μέγα β. ἴσον τῷ μεγάλῳ κακῷ 3rd c.BC: Callimachus Epicus “Fragmenta” 359.}}
